Package: icechunkr
Title: Icechunk Transactional Array Repositories
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Michael D.", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bindings to the 'Icechunk' Rust library: storage, repositories,
    branches, tags, snapshots, sessions, commits, conflict resolution, and
    virtual chunk references with explicit authorisation of the locations
    they point to. Sessions can be handed to other native code as bytes.
    Chunk references of any snapshot can be read as a table.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/hypertidy/icechunk-r
BugReports: https://github.com/hypertidy/icechunk-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.95
Imports:
    DBI,
    jsonlite,
    methods
Suggests:
